ate pressure, friction, and heat. Gemstone capacitors bend the path of an electron with a lense so that the electrons must follow a longer path to reach their destination. This elongated path also acts as a buffer to contain electrons on this elongated path. This type of resistor acts as a capacitor.  Time crystals:  If a crystal elongates the path of an electron. Time is literally dialated for an electron within this path. An electron could travel for 1 hour in a crystal and from the outside of the crystal we would see it only 1 second after pressing a switch.","topics":[],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":158227},{"name":"thomasmchen/uist-2021","owner":"thomasmchen","html_url":"https://github.com/thomasmchen/uist-2021","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":158228},{"name":"trriplejay/jfrog-pipelines-samples","owner":"trriplejay","html_url":"https://github.com/trriplejay/jfrog-pipelines-samples","stars":0,"forks":6,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Samples for JFrog Pipelines","topics":[],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":158229},{"name":"pwbriggs/pwbriggs","owner":"pwbriggs","html_url":"https://github.com/pwbriggs/pwbriggs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Config files for my GitHub profile.","topics":["config","github-config"],"score":2144.8,"global_rank":158230},{"name":"astray1988/scala-reference-CN","owner":"astray1988","html_url":"https://github.com/astray1988/scala-reference-CN","stars":6,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2144.0,"global_rank":158231},{"name":"nexusdev/token-faucet","owner":"nexusdev","html_url":"https://github.com/nexusdev/token-faucet","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Faucet which pays a fraction of its remaining balance from a fixed token address on each `claim`.","topics":[],"score":2144.0,"globa